{"op":"add","path":"/elements/methodology","value":{"type":"TextBlock","props":{"content":"This analysis covers twelve months of subscription activity across three pricing plans. New MRR reflects revenue from first-time subscribers, expansion MRR from upgrades or seat additions, and churn MRR from cancellations or downgrades. Cumulative MRR is the running total of net new MRR added each period. Month-over-month growth rates compare consecutive cumulative MRR values. The Plan filter adjusts the component breakdown and plan-level totals; the cumulative trend and growth rate charts reflect overall performance across all plans.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
